WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:05.700
AuthzLedger 1.6 engineering preview.
From scope to signed report.

00:06.050 --> 00:09.900
The 1.5.0 demo shows a protected marker
in an HTTP 403 response.

00:10.080 --> 00:13.800
Three local exports
from Nmap, ffuf and Nuclei.

00:14.080 --> 00:19.850
Four observations and one hint.
No imported finding is confirmed.

00:20.150 --> 00:25.700
A separate test combines a HAR capture
with three tool exports.

00:26.100 --> 00:31.700
Five observations share one route.
Each can be traced to its source.

00:32.100 --> 00:38.700
The 1.5.0 retest verified one fix.
The second finding was not retested.

00:39.050 --> 00:45.700
One byte changed in a signed package copy.
Both verifiers rejected it.

00:46.100 --> 00:50.200
1.6 is an engineering preview.
The public release is 1.5.0.

00:50.250 --> 00:53.850
Ask for “Pilot” on LinkedIn.
Nasser Aldin Farag, 0xFarag.
